{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51291","headline":"过芜湖 · 刘秩","name":"过芜湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百里芜湖县，封侯自汉朝。\n荻林秋带雨，沙浦晚生潮。\n近海鱼盐富，濒淮粟麦饶。\n相逢白头叟，击壤颂唐尧。\n（《嘉庆芜湖县志》二三《艺文志》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘秩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}